  "accepted_changes": [
    "Authored short daily action, recipient and reply phrases; authored priorities are not measured corpus frequencies",
    "Bounded handover relation evidence across 12 transient Han characters, requiring action + status before 畀/俾 and a supported recipient; 2 points without an explicit sender, 3 with a pronoun sender; plural recipient counted once",
    "Completion question evidence 3 points with a handover relation, otherwise 1.5; continuation after 未 withdraws tentative question preference",
    "Pronoun + action + 咗/返/緊 grammatical preference (1.5) kept independent of the capped lexical phrase preference",
    "Unchanged model, 48-path beam, 24 character option cap, confidence filter, local learning storage, Single mode and Fold7 layout"
  ],
